  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4002.15 Spill-proof spout",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4002.15 “Spill-proof spout” means any spout that complies with all of the performance standards specified in Env-A 4003.02, and with all of the labeling requirements specified in Env-A 4004.01.\n\nSource. #9064, eff 1-9-08",
